  "ingredients": [
    "2 sprigs rosemary, leaves stripped and chopped",
    "1 tablespoon chopped fresh thyme",
    "1 cup olive oil",
    "1 whole pheasant, cleaned",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 250 degrees F (120 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/m1Tz38O0Df0vgNEXbESZslQarlg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/216197-roast-pheasant-dmfs-step-01-23ff78acc96340ea9f86d8a0a33d8ee1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216197/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir rosemary and thyme into olive oil in a liquid measure; set aside. Rub pheasant inside and out with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/57dNaqWizpyWNs3Swleneo4-NYE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/216197-roast-pheasant-dmfs-step-02-684cd923b95847c8af84e3c7fb0a48b8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216197/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place into a close-fitting roasting pan. Pour herb oil over pheasant.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mygAxctxbxh9Ya9NxDhFQ4SQobA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/216197-roast-pheasant-dmfs-step-03-3745dc9dfc894ec7a4e6fc001cab68e6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216197/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 1 hour, then cover with aluminum foil and continue baking until an instant-read thermometer inserted into the thickest part of the thigh, near the bone, reads 180 degrees F (82 degrees C), about 1 hour more. Baste pheasant with pan juices every 30 minutes during baking. Remove from the oven, cover with a doubled sheet of aluminum foil, and allow to rest in a warm area for 10 minutes before slicing.",
      "section": null,
